                                                "sense_id": "238d0485-1170-3d16-af67-42f600e427cb",
                                                "text": "There’s a certain magic to fonio, a tiny golden grain believed to be Africa’s oldest cultivated cereal. The ancient grain’s potential to solve pressing modern environmental and economic challenges inspired Pierre Thiam, the Senegalese-born chef, to become fonio’s No 1 champion."
                                            }
